<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts wireless cable.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts wireless cable.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut People's Choice TV Corp to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cut Heartland Wireless Communications Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut Wireless One Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
</text>
